-- Rust binding for the namespace-level operations of anthill.prelude. Proposal 038.
--
-- `todo()` (WI-20261017-JRHZ0) is the one so far: the hole an unwritten operation's body
-- is, whose host function faults with `EvalError::NotImplemented` naming the running
-- operation. A NAMESPACE target, as most of `anthill.reflect`'s surface is — that
-- binding says why a namespace is a legitimate `operation_map` target.
namespace anthill.prelude
  provides anthill.prelude language rust
    artifact "rustland/anthill-core/src/eval/builtins.rs"
    operation_map {
      todo: "prelude_todo"
    }
  end
end
